<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Panmure ups Standard, Abbey.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Panmure ups Standard, Abbey.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Chartered Plc  and Abbey National Plc were upgraded by Panmure Gordon, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>Analyst David Pountney at Panmure said the upgrades followed recent poor performances by both stocks.</p>
<p>He moved Abbey to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; after its 10 percent decline of the past week, and he upped Standard to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;sell&quot; after its steady 16 percent drop from last month's record high.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
